### Handy requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
# 1) run the login request below, 2) paste the token here
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "ChangeMe123!" }

GET {{base}}/health

### Sale that must be REJECTED (more large apples than stock)
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vendor_id": 1, "payment_method": "CREDIT",
  "items": [ {"fruit_id": 1, "packaging_size": "LARGE", "quantity": 10} ] }

### Valid sale
POST {{base}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vendor_id": 2, "payment_method": "CASH", "amount_paid": 300,
  "items": [ {"fruit_id": 5, "packaging_size": "MEDIUM", "quantity": 2} ] }

### Low stock / stock per size
GET {{base}}/stock/low?threshold=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
GET {{base}}/fruits/1/stock

### Vendor search
GET {{base}}/vendors/search?q=Mpho
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reports
GET {{base}}/reports/top-fruits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
GET {{base}}/reports/revenue?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
GET {{base}}/reports/top-vendor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
GET {{base}}/reports/stock-levels
GET {{base}}/reports/outstanding-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
